@[expose] public section

/-! # The control registers live at the softmax warps' states

The softmax machine states facts for the control registers only (`Machine.lean`): the registers
live at a state's instruction that are not data registers, that is, not computed from the scores
or the bias: `ctlLive pc` is the generated liveness (`Flow.live`) without the data ranges. The
segment tactics read the live function of a machine's facts at every program counter they
walk, so the filter is a function of the program counter. -/

namespace PTX.Kernels.TmlFa4Fwd.Proof.Softmax
open PTX

